    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the local village to sniff out mischievous doggos and elusive items in this cozy, charming, and hand-drawn hidden object adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Labby and meet Rolo, Weenie, Biff, and Shep. Solve their troubles, earn their trust, and chase your dream of making a video game!</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363810/extras/e0e9dbd84b8319dc5be08c07d9d6555d.avif?t=1755513626\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><strong>Explore 15 Hand-Drawn Levels</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>500+</strong> dogs and items to find!<br></li><li>Use the <strong>dog whistle</strong> to startle mischievous mutts when you get stuck.<br></li><li>Enjoy cozy village sounds and watch levels <strong>animate to the music</strong>.</li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363810/extras/efdf3e065235f83fd8fbad822ed0a890.avif?t=1755513626\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><strong>Unlock 4 Unique Areas</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Choose</strong> the order you explore: the Farmhouse, the Manor and more!<br></li><li>Each area has its own <strong>theme</strong> and original <strong>soundtrack</strong>. <br></li><li>Watch the <strong>map come alive as you progress</strong>, as planes, trains and boats appear - the more you find, the more the village grows!</li></ul> <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363810/extras/3781e821580c56da42f0a5df50058a36.avif?t=1755513626\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><strong>Meet Rolo, Weenie, Biff and Shep</strong> <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Each dog has their <strong>own story</strong>, with challenges to overcome.<br></li><li>Solve their troubles, <strong>make friends</strong>, and recruit their help to make a video game!</li></ul>",
